Well, good morning everybody, or good afternoon,
depending on what time zone you're in.

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:13.750
Welcome to the BD2K guide to the fundamentals
of data science.

00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:18.210
I'm Michelle Dunn, I'm in the office of the
associate director for data science.

00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:22.240
Please go to the next slide.

00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:26.420
I just wanted to say a few things about where
we are in this series.

00:00:26.420 --> 00:00:38.760
We started with a wonderful talk by Mark Musen
in early September that gave us an overview

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:44.900
